step Skinning 75-100: Beasts 1-17
  tip Skin from Skinning 75 to 100 for Embossed Leather Gloves: this area gives Light Leather, and the next one the rest from Skinning 100. The window lists the areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests once you are in it; each keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns.
