step Heavy Armor Kit to 158
  tip Heavy Armor Kit is yellow at 150 (yellow 145, green 155, grey 165): about 15 crafts to 158, up to 20 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 5 Heavy Leather and 1 Fine Thread. Five Heavy Leather a craft (beasts of level 28-40); the kits sell to vendors. If you got here without learning Heavy Armor Kit, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it.
  learn 3780
  craft 3780 until 158

step Skin Heavy Leather
  tip 56 Heavy Leather for Leatherworking 158-165: 7 Barbaric Shoulders. Skin 56 Heavy Leather at the areas of Skinning 200-225, the richest in it (they give no more points), then craft 7 Barbaric Shoulders (Leatherworking 158 to 165). The window lists the Skinning areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
  collect 4234 x156 gather Skinning 200
