step Guardian Gloves to 180
  tip Guardian Gloves is orange at 165 (yellow 185, green 195, grey 205): about 15 crafts to 180, a point every craft. Each takes 4 Heavy Leather, 1 Cured Heavy Hide and 1 Silken Thread. Make the 5 Cured Heavy Hide first. Use the 10 Cured Heavy Hide you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data. If you got here without learning Cured Heavy Hide, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it.
